{"seq":2,"slug":"probabilistic-models","title":"概率检索模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/indexing-models/probabilistic-models","wordCount":1130,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"概率检索模型\">概率检索模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>概率检索模型从概率论的角度定义信息检索问题：给定查询 q 和文档 d，计算 d 与 q 相关的概率 P(R=1|q,d)，并按照这个概率对所有文档进行排序。概率排序原理（Probability Ranking Principle，PRP）指出，按照相关概率降序排列文档可以最小化检索系统的期望损失——这是概率模型的理论基石。BM25 作为概率模型家族中最成功的成员，至今仍是工业界最广泛使用的排序基线。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 概率检索框架&#10;        Q[查询 q] --&gt; E[概率估计]&#10;        D[文档 d] --&gt; E&#10;        CS[集合统计] --&gt; E&#10;        E --&gt; P[&quot;P(R=1|q,d)&quot;]&#10;        P --&gt; R[排序]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 概率检索框架\n        Q[查询 q] --&gt; E[概率估计]\n        D[文档 d] --&gt; E\n        CS[集合统计] --&gt; E\n        E --&gt; P[\"P(R=1|q,d)\"]\n        P --&gt; R[排序]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概率模型</th>\n<th>核心假设</th>\n<th>参数来源</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Binary Independence Model</td>\n<td>词项独立</td>\n<td>相关性反馈</td>\n<td>Robertson-Sparck Jones</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BM25</td>\n<td>词项独立 + TF 饱和</td>\n<td>集合统计</td>\n<td>Okapi BM25</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言模型</td>\n<td>文档生成查询</td>\n<td>最大似然估计</td>\n<td>Query Likelihood</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两阶段模型</td>\n<td>主题 + 内容</td>\n<td>混合估计</td>\n<td>Ponte-Croft</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"bm25-排序算法\">BM25 排序算法</h2><p>BM25（Best Matching 25）是由 Stephen Robertson 等人在 TREC 评测中提出的排序公式，它在概率模型的理论框架下融合了词频饱和、文档长度归一化和 IDF 权重三个关键机制。</p>\n<p>BM25 对查询中每个词项 t 在文档 d 中的得分计算如下：对每个查询词项 t，其贡献分数 = IDF(t) × (tf(t,d) × (k1 + 1)) / (tf(t,d) + k1 × (1 - b + b × dl/avgdl))。其中 tf(t,d) 是词项 t 在文档 d 中的词频，dl 是文档长度，avgdl 是平均文档长度，k1 和 b 是可调参数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface BM25Config {&#10;  readonly k1: number;&#10;  readonly b: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CollectionStats {&#10;  readonly totalDocs: number;&#10;  readonly avgDocLength: number;&#10;  readonly docFrequencies: Map&lt;string, number&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const bm25Score = (&#10;  queryTerms: ReadonlyArray&lt;string&gt;,&#10;  docTermFreqs: Map&lt;string, number&gt;,&#10;  docLength: number,&#10;  stats: CollectionStats,&#10;  config: BM25Config = { k1: 1.2, b: 0.75 },&#10;): number =&gt; {&#10;  let score = 0;&#10;  for (const term of queryTerms) {&#10;    const tf = docTermFreqs.get(term) ?? 0;&#10;    if (tf === 0) continue;&#10;    const df = stats.docFrequencies.get(term) ?? 0;&#10;    const idf = Math.log((stats.totalDocs - df + 0.5) / (df + 0.5) + 1);&#10;    const tfNorm =&#10;      (tf * (config.k1 + 1)) / (tf + config.k1 * (1 - config.b + (config.b * docLength) / stats.avgDocLength));&#10;    score += idf * tfNorm;&#10;  }&#10;  return score;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BM25Config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> k1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CollectionStats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> totalDocs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> avgDocLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> docFrequencies</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bm25Score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  queryTerms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  docTermFreqs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  docLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  stats</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CollectionStats</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BM25Config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { k1: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, b: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> term</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queryTerms) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> docTermFreqs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(term) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tf </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> df</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats.docFrequencies.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(term) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> idf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((stats.totalDocs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (df </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tfNorm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      (tf </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (config.k1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tf </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.k1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (config.b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> docLength) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats.avgDocLength));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idf </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tfNorm;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>k1 控制词频饱和的速度——k1 越大，高词频的边际收益越明显；k1=0 时退化为布尔模型（有没有这个词）。b 控制文档长度归一化的强度——b=1 时完全归一化（长文档被严格惩罚），b=0 时不做归一化。经验上 k1=1.2, b=0.75 是最常用的默认值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph BM25 参数效果&#10;        K1[&quot;k1 ↑&quot;] --&gt; TF[&quot;TF 饱和更慢&quot;]&#10;        K1L[&quot;k1 ↓&quot;] --&gt; TFS[&quot;TF 快速饱和&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;b ↑&quot;] --&gt; DL[&quot;长度归一化强&quot;]&#10;        BL[&quot;b ↓&quot;] --&gt; DLS[&quot;长度归一化弱&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph BM25 参数效果\n        K1[\"k1 ↑\"] --&gt; TF[\"TF 饱和更慢\"]\n        K1L[\"k1 ↓\"] --&gt; TFS[\"TF 快速饱和\"]\n        B[\"b ↑\"] --&gt; DL[\"长度归一化强\"]\n        BL[\"b ↓\"] --&gt; DLS[\"长度归一化弱\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>调优建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>k1</td>\n<td>1.2</td>\n<td>控制 TF 饱和度</td>\n<td>短查询增大，长查询减小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>b</td>\n<td>0.75</td>\n<td>文档长度归一化</td>\n<td>长度差异大时增大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"binary-independence-model\">Binary Independence Model</h2><p>BIM（Binary Independence Model）是概率检索的理论基础模型。它假设词项在相关文档和不相关文档中的出现概率是独立的，通过贝叶斯定理推导出文档的相关性得分。</p>\n<p>BIM 的推导起点是「概率排序原理」——我们希望按照 P(R=1|d,q) / P(R=0|d,q) 的比值对文档排序。通过贝叶斯展开和独立性假设，这个比值可以分解为每个查询词项的对数似然比之和。这个推导结果与 IDF 加权的直觉一致——在相关文档中出现概率高、在不相关文档中出现概率低的词项应获得更高权重。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface BIMParameters {&#10;  readonly pRelevant: Map&lt;string, number&gt;;&#10;  readonly pNonRelevant: Map&lt;string, number&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const bimScore = (queryTerms: ReadonlyArray&lt;string&gt;, docTerms: Set&lt;string&gt;, params: BIMParameters): number =&gt; {&#10;  let score = 0;&#10;  for (const term of queryTerms) {&#10;    const present = docTerms.has(term);&#10;    const pR = params.pRelevant.get(term) ?? 0.5;&#10;    const pNR = params.pNonRelevant.get(term) ?? 0.5;&#10;    if (present) {&#10;      score += Math.log(pR / pNR);&#10;    } else {&#10;      score += Math.log((1 - pR) / (1 - pNR));&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  return score;&#10;};&#10;&#10;const estimateFromFeedback = (&#10;  term: string,&#10;  relevantDocs: ReadonlyArray&lt;Set&lt;string&gt;&gt;,&#10;  nonRelevantDocs: ReadonlyArray&lt;Set&lt;string&gt;&gt;,&#10;): { pR: number; pNR: number } =&gt; {&#10;  const rContaining = relevantDocs.filter((d) =&gt; d.has(term)).length;&#10;  const nrContaining = nonRelevantDocs.filter((d) =&gt; d.has(term)).length;&#10;  const pR = (rContaining + 0.5) / (relevantDocs.length + 1);&#10;  const pNR = (nrContaining + 0.5) / (nonRelevantDocs.length + 1);&#10;  return { pR, pNR };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BIMParameters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> pRelevant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shi