:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fieldConfig.boost </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> normalizedTF;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> k1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.fields[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]?.k1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idf </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (combinedTF </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (k1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> combinedTF));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>BM25 变体</th>\n<th>改进点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>复杂度增加</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BM25F</td>\n<td>多字段加权</td>\n<td>结构化文档</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BM25+</td>\n<td>TF 下界保护</td>\n<td>长文档集合</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BM25T</td>\n<td>词项特异性参数</td>\n<td>异构语料</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BM25-Adpt</td>\n<td>自适应参数</td>\n<td>自动调参</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>概率检索模型基于概率排序原理，按相关概率降序排列文档以最小化期望损失</li>\n<li>BM25 融合词频饱和、文档长度归一化和 IDF 三大机制，是工业界的标准基线算法</li>\n<li>k1 控制 TF 饱和速度，b 控制文档长度归一化强度，典型值为 k1=1.2, b=0.75</li>\n<li>BIM 通过贝叶斯推导和独立性假设，为概率检索提供了坚实的理论基础</li>\n<li>BM25F 通过多字段加权扩展处理结构化文档，BM25+ 修正长文档的分数下界问题</li>\n<li>BM25 虽然是经典方法，但在现代搜索系统中仍是不可替代的基线和混合检索的关键组件</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"概率检索模型","id":"概率检索模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"BM25 排序算法","id":"bm25-排序算法"},{"level":2,"text":"Binary Independence Model","id":"binary-independence-model"},{"level":2,"text":"BM25 的变体与改进","id":"bm25-的变体与改进"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"倒排索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/indexing-models/inverted-index"},"next":{"title":"语言模型检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/indexing-models/language-models"}}